id": "8a550378-6437-408f-8537-8e67e722f906", "knowledge_title": "T0188", "parent_chunk_id": null, "score": 0.015083672546359114, "snippet": "工单 T0188｜产品 EUFY-X9-PRO\n现象：找不到基站\n原因：基站位置遮挡\n处理步骤：调整基站到靠墙开阔位置\n结果：solved", "source": "kb_tickets"}], "kb": "kb_tickets", "key": "15822b5bd88fc393accda41f8c91b34e07ab1be6812fc04413281e1986db734f", "kind": "knowledge", "query": "eufy X9 Pro 不吸了 滚刷缠头发", "scope": {"category": "robot_vacuum", "product_state": "confirmed_sku", "sku": "EUFY-X9-PRO"}, "status": "ok", "top_k": 5, "truncated": false}
